# package-lock.json is deliberately NOT ignored (M18.5).
#
# It was, by the template default above, and that is what made dependency
# resolution non-reproducible across machines — the direct cause of the
# autolinking failure in ADR 0006. This project uses npm; the lockfile is the
# only record of what actually resolved.

# M24B candidate sources: 129 MB of third-party originals, deliberately absent.
#
# Everything needed to get them back is committed — direct URL, SHA-256 of the
# bytes as published, and the pinned conditioning arguments — in
# assets/audio/music/candidates/SOURCES.json. `npm run build:candidates --
# --fetch` re-downloads, hash-verifies and re-derives every candidate
# byte-for-byte. The derivatives the game actually plays ARE committed.
#
# rock_theme_song.mid stays tracked: it is 2 KB and it is the only proof of
# showTheme's notated 120 BPM (ADR 0013).
assets/audio/music/source/*.ogg
assets/audio/music/source/*.mp3
assets/audio/music/source/*.wav
assets/audio/music/source/*.flac

# Local build output (M24B audition APKs and anything else copied out of
# android/app/build). Reproduce with `npm run build:audition`.
build-out/
